  "description": "Subject: Docker\u2011Compose Service Specification \u2013 Web and Database Containers  \n\nThe **web** service is built from the local directory\u202f`./web` using the Dockerfile\u202f`Dockerfile.dev`. It launches with the command\u202f`python app.py`, runs detached, and is identified by the container name **my_web**. Resource limits include 1\u202f024\u202fCPU shares, a memory cap of **512\u202fMiB**, and a swap limit of **1\u202fGiB**; the process runs in the host PID namespace and is attached to the **bridge** network under the hostname **webhost** with the domain\u202f`example.com`. Capabilities added are **NET_ADMIN** and dropped **MKNOD**; the container is not privileged (`false`), is not read\u2011only, and has STDIN open (`true`) with a TTY allocated (`true`). It starts from the entrypoint\u202f`/entrypoint.sh`, uses the environment file\u202f`.env`, and sets environment variables **DEBUG=true** and **PORT=8000**. Ports\u202f`8000:8000` are exposed, and the internal port\u202f8000 is also listed under expose. DNS servers **8.8.8.8** and **8.8.4.4** with search domain\u202f`example.com` are configured, as are extra hosts mapping **host1** to\u202f`10.0.0.1`. The MAC address is **02:42:ac:11:00:02**. Labels include `com.example.description=Web Service`. Logging uses the **json\u2011file** driver with a maximum size of **10\u202fm**. The container mounts the project directory (`.:/code`) and the log directory (`/var/log/web:/var/log/web`), works from `/code`, and has no external links, no additional container links, and no volumes\u2011from other containers. It is set to always restart and applies the security option `seccomp=unconfined`.  \n\nThe **db** service runs from the pre\u2011built image **postgres:13** and is named **my_db**. It listens on port **5432:5432**, uses a volume mapping `/var/lib/postgresql/data:/var/lib/postgresql/data` for persistent storage, and is limited to **1\u202f024** units of memory. Environment variables are supplied as a list: `POSTGRES_PASSWORD=example` and `POSTGRES_DB=mydb`. The container\u2019s hostname is **dbhost**, it carries the label `com.example.role=database`, and its logs are sent to the **syslog** driver with no additional options. The restart policy is **on\u2011failure**. No other optional fields (such as caps, devices, extra hosts, etc.) are defined for this service."
